cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Gözcü — aerial search-and-rescue detection assistant"
message: >-
  If you use this software or refer to its results, please cite it as below.
  Please cite the HERIDAL dataset separately using the preferred-citation entry.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kaya
    given-names: Onur
    alias: onurrkayaa
repository-code: "https://github.com/onurrkayaa/gozcu"
abstract: >-
  Operator-support prototype for detecting human candidates in aerial
  search-and-rescue imagery. Images are scanned as 512 px tiles with 20% overlap
  so that small targets keep their original scale, and candidates are presented
  to a human operator for review. Undergraduate graduation project; research and
  education only.
keywords:
  - search-and-rescue
  - object-detection
  - aerial-imagery
  - small-object-detection
  - computer-vision
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    Deep Learning Approach in Aerial Imagery for Supporting Land Search and
    Rescue Missions
  authors:
    - family-names: Božić-Štulić
      given-names: Dunja
    - family-names: Marušić
      given-names: Željko
    - family-names: Gotovac
      given-names: Sven
  journal: International Journal of Computer Vision
  volume: 127
  start: 1256
  end: 1278
  year: 2019
  doi: 10.1007/s11263-019-01177-1
  notes: >-
    The HERIDAL dataset used by this project. The dataset itself is not included
    in the repository.
